	// Configure wraps gtk_adjustment_configure
	// 
	// The function takes the following parameters:
	// 
	// 	- value float64: the new value 
	// 	- lower float64: the new minimum value 
	// 	- upper float64: the new maximum value 
	// 	- stepIncrement float64: the new step increment 
	// 	- pageIncrement float64: the new page increment 
	// 	- pageSize float64: the new page size 
	//
	// Sets all properties of the adjustment at once.
	// 
	// Use this function to avoid multiple emissions of the
	// #GtkAdjustment::changed signal. See gtk_adjustment_set_lower()
	// for an alternative way of compressing multiple emissions of
	// #GtkAdjustment::changed into one.
