// The function takes the following parameters:
// 
// 	- value float64: the initial value 
// 	- lower float64: the minimum value 
// 	- upper float64: the maximum value 
// 	- stepIncrement float64: the step increment 
// 	- pageIncrement float64: the page increment 
// 	- pageSize float64: the page size 
// 
