	// SetShowTabs wraps gtk_notebook_set_show_tabs
	// 
	// The function takes the following parameters:
	// 
	// 	- showTabs bool: %TRUE if the tabs should be shown 
	//
	// Sets whether to show the tabs for the notebook or not.
	SetShowTabs(bool)
	// SetTabDetachable wraps gtk_notebook_set_tab_detachable
	// 
	// The function takes the following parameters:
	// 
	// 	- child Widget: a child #GtkWidget 
	// 	- detachable bool: whether the tab is detachable or not 
	//
	// Sets whether the tab can be detached from @notebook to another
