	// ScrollToCell wraps gtk_tree_view_scroll_to_cell
	// 
	// The function takes the following parameters:
	// 
	// 	- path *TreePath (nullable): The path of the row to move to, or %NULL. 
	// 	- column TreeViewColumn (nullable): The #GtkTreeViewColumn to move horizontally to, or %NULL. 
	// 	- useAlign bool: whether to use alignment arguments, or %FALSE. 
	// 	- rowAlign float32: The vertical alignment of the row specified by @path. 
