	//
	// Repositions the menu according to its position function.
	Reposition()
	// SetAccelGroup wraps gtk_menu_set_accel_group
	// 
	// The function takes the following parameters:
	// 
	// 	- accelGroup AccelGroup (nullable): the #GtkAccelGroup to be associated
	//               with the menu. 
	//
	// Set the #GtkAccelGroup which holds global accelerators for the
	// menu.  This accelerator group needs to also be added to all windows
	// that this menu is being used in with gtk_window_add_accel_group(),
