	// BindModel wraps gtk_popover_bind_model
	// 
	// The function takes the following parameters:
	// 
	// 	- model gio.MenuModel (nullable): the #GMenuModel to bind to or %NULL to remove
	//   binding 
	// 	- actionNamespace string (nullable): the namespace for actions in @model 
	//
